WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.770
OP sequence

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:10.850
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:08.420
Henri-sensei, time passes really quickly.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:14.890
Three months have passed since I transferred to St. Marie Academy.

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:16.820
closed captions

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:21.310
I think you are aware of this from your time here on St. Marie but,

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:27.960
on Christmas Eve the students from the academy are all busy making Christmas cakes for charity.

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:35.830
Since all of the proceeds mostly go to local children in need, everyone is really into it.

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:39.430
I'm doing my best,

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:43.850
not to lose to everyone and to be able to see you sooner.

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:48.620
Take care of your health, Amano Ichigo.

