00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:59.850
recipe 12

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:59.850
The Seven Year Merry Christmas

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:04.210
It's kind of lonely without Vanilla and the others.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:06.410
You're irritating, saying that over and over again.

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:10.960
They have to prepare for the Christmas party in the Kingdom of Sweets, so it can't be helped.

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:16.190
Cafe-kun seems to have been chosen to be in charge of the party, so he was all excited.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:18.660
But will those guys be alright?

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:21.860
They aren't able to help with the Christmas cakes we're making today.

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.530
Eh? What do you mean?

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:30.130
Don't Caramel and the others have to send the cards of completed sweets to the Queen?

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:34.850
They get points for that, so I guess it affects their grading.

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:37.880
Oh, I see.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:43.030
If we are unable to finish the cakes today, it has to be painful not to be able to send the cards.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:46.700
Ichigo-chan, could that be...

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.190
Oh, you know?

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:50.800
Yeah, that's a Croqembouche.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:52.200
Good job, Amano-san.

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:58.200
I remembered my grandma made them before when I was little, and I figure I challenge myself to make them.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:05.880
It's a hill of Choux cream!

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.740
Looks like a Christmas tree, doesn't it?

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:11.780
Yeah! It's really beautiful!

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:15.490
This is a cake called a Croqembouche.

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:20.410
There are various different types of cream filling inside the Choux cream.

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:21.750
Won't it be interesting?

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:23.500
Yeah! I can't wait!

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:26.320
It's my first time seeing such a Christmas cake!

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:31.680
To tell you the truth, this isn't a Christmas cake.

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:35.870
These are usually made on the occasion of various celebrations.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.080
It's not a Christmas cake?

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:45.250
Well, any cake is fine for celebrating Christmas.

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:52.410
If you put your heart into making it, and it puts a smile on the faces of the people eating it,

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:55.760
there's no need to worry about tradition.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:05:00.620
Your grandma always thinks like that when she makes cakes.

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:06.110
Don't worry about the little matters, and let your creativity run free.

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:13.340
The Croqembouche I ate then... was really delicious.

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:18.240
Each and every one of those Choux cream were filled with Grandma's love.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.060
Amano.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:23.460
A Croqembouche is not a Christmas cake.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:30.280
True. It seems to be made for weddings and other celebrations.

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:34.470
But I think making it like a Christmas tree is a very good idea.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:40.080
I also think it's well made, but I guess you can't make a normal Christmas cake.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.510
And you only made one, too.

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:45.330
Are you complimenting me? You don't have to hold back!

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:50.340
Even I know that a Croqembouche isn't a Christmas cake.

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:54.840
But, grandma said that if you let yourself get boxed in by common sense,

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:57.860
you won't be able to bake cakes that make everyone smile.

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:06.150
I suppose your free spirit comes from your grandmother.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:07.870
She seemed like a wonderful person.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:09.970
Yeah, thanks!

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:12.320
She's really irritating.

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:15.160
She can't be conceited for long.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:17.840
Chinatsu, I'll be using this.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:23.650
Ikue, you aren't thinking... such a lame plan will work?

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.140
I'll show it to the teacher!

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:31.560
Ichigo-chan?

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:35.590
No way...

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:37.580
She really didn't notice it...

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:41.560
Geez... I made it so well just awhile ago!

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:44.560
There's no time to remake it.

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:48.010
We'll help you to make some simple cake instead.

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:50.610
Okay, thanks.

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:55.450
But then, that's the first time I've ever seen someone actually slip on a banana peel.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:59.030
Kashino! You bastard!

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:04.600
Ah! Welcome, welcome!

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:11.630
We're starting a special sale of Christmas cakes baked by everyone from St. Marie Academy!

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:18.100
All proceeds go to charity, so thank you for your support!

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:21.620
However everyone can only buy one per person!

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.460
It's a different selling method from Salon de Marie, isn't it?

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:27.230
Now, please unveil your cakes.

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:31.650
What a wonderful Christmas cake!

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:33.480
This one is really cute, too!

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:35.470
My children will be so pleased!

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:39.360
Merry Christmas! Thank you very much.

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:43.330
Thank you, that'll be 2800 yen.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:46.640
Thank you. Candles are included at no extra charge.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:48.540
I'll take this, please.

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:50.060
Right. Thank you very much.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.740
Eh? Why am I the only one that doesn't have a line?

00:07:56.200 --> 00:08:01.690
St. Marie Academy

00:07:56.200 --> 00:08:01.690
X'mas <b>cake charity</b>

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:59.840
We still have many Christmas cakes left!

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:01.710
Would you like one?

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:03.720
Would you?

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:07.020
Grandmother, how would you like a Christmas cake?

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:11.810
Oh my, you haven't sold yours yet?

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:13.820
And to think you're in the A-group...

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:16.280
It's not gonna be possible with such a cake.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:19.240
She didn't have enough time to prepare the cakes.

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:21.360
I feel sorry for Amano-san.

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:23.240
Is there anything we can do for her?

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:27.560
I guess I can only cheer her up wth my smile at times like this.

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:32.210
Can I get this wrapped?

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.320
I'd like to buy this.

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:39.340
Right! Thank you very much!

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:45.140
Thanks for waiting! 2800 yen, please!

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:48.640
Please donate the change to charity.

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.050
Thank you very much!

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:52.270
That's great, Ichigo-chan.

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:54.590
That Croqembouche would have sold quickly though.

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:57.800
What's the matter? Someone you know?

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:01.810
I feel like I've seen him somewhere... But where?

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:02.710
Charity Collection

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:09.360
To all the students of St. Marie Academy.

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:15.880
I will make sure to send your warm kindness to all those children in need.

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:18.020
Thank you so much for today.

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:23.750
We have some time until the Christmas party at the academy, so what should we do?

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:28.040
Why don't we go check out what kind of cakes the shops around town are selling for Christmas?

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.950
That's really unrefined, Ma-chan.

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:32.500
At least, forget about sweets on Christmas.

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:34.930
Eh? Isn't that the person from before?

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:35.540
What? What kind of a pâtissier would I be if I forgot about sweets?

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:36.930
What's the matter, Ichigo-chan?

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:36.930
You don't have to get so angry!

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:40.010
Umm...

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:47.970
You're the guy from earlier...

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.960
Mister, is something the matter?

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:54.600
Did you dislike my cake?

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:56.780
It's not that.

00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:02.160
I want to present the cake, yet I can't gather the courage.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:03.380
Courage?

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:06.370
Ah! I remember now!

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:10.670
You're Sakaguchi Yousuke-san from the Miles Jarrett Quintet, aren't you!?

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:12.310
Yeah...

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:13.770
I knew it!

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:16.860
I'm a huge fan of the Miles Jarrett Quintet!

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:18.470
I bought all your CDs!

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:20.890
T-Thanks.

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:25.400
T-The what Jaret something or other?

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:22.750
This is such an honor.

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:26.750
I never in my dreams thought I'd meet you in person!

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:29.660
They're a famous jazz band that centers around New York.

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:29.660
I always wanted to see you live on stage one time!

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:32.910
Ma-chan listens to them almost everyday.

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:34.040
I'm still in middle school so I can't go into clubs and things,

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.270
I only listen to classical music.

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:36.270
but when I get older I'm definitely going to hear you play!

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:53.250
You said you didn't have the courage to give it to someone earlier...

00:10:55.080 --> 00:11:02.260
You all might not have seen such an adult but... Long ago there was a woman in this city who I used to live together with who said this.

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:08.070
That was on Christmas, 7 years ago.

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:14.270
That's when I threw her away, and ran off to New York.

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:15.120
Threw away?

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:29.660
Yeah... In December of the same year, when Miles Band had only four members, they played a gig at a jazz club here in Japan.

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:24.470
I was a backup player, but Miles called me out front. And I stood on the same stage as them.

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:40.530
To be able to perform along with Miles, my idol,

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:45.410
I was so exhilarated and I blasted out all of those feelings!

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:55.060
Miles took an interest in me and invited me to come with him back to New York.

00:12:56.060 --> 00:13:01.050
It was my chance to be a musician in New York with Miles, my inspiration!

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.050
It was a chance that would never come again.

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:11.510
I became a member of the band, left Mariko behind in Japan, and traveled to New York.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:26.710
But, during the seven years I've lived in New York, I've never once forgotten about her.

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:30.980
And then, the band scheduled a public performance in Japan.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:37.500
I who lost those seven years, tried to meet Mariko and apologize to her.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:42.220
But if I really did meet her,

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:46.710
I imagined things like "Mariko's probably already married"...

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:50.260
"To a cruel guy like me, I wonder if she even wants to see me."

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:59.040
Thinking about that, my legs won't move. And as you can see, I didn't prepare anything and then I returned here.

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.260
You should go see her.

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:09.430
Even if she's married, or however you treated her in the past,

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:11.480
if you're a man then you should apologize to her.

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:19.140
I think your performances as a real jazz man in the band you've joined are really cool, Sakaguchi-san.

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:22.200
That kind of a person can definitely do it.

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:25.210
You must see her, and apologize.

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:27.920
Kashino's really passionate today.

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:30.430
That's just the way he is.

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:33.370
I also think you should meet her.

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:34.350
Amano...

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:37.930
You'll never know what's become of Mariko-san if you don't.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:41.250
You've loved her all this time, right?

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:44.170
You never once forgot about her these seven years, right!?

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:46.900
Is it really alright to end it without telling her those feelings?

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:55.660
Let's give Mariko-san those feelings of yours, together with the Christmas cake.

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:56.990
Amano.

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:00.080
Do you know where Mariko-san is?

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:04.040
I don't know...

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:07.440
Geez. You're really a brainless person.

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:12.050
I still remember a restaurant where Mariko used to work.

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:23.020
Store for Rent
Please inquire at the real estate office

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:26.570
Could this mean it has already folded?

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:28.610
How was it?

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:31.990
It looks like the restaurant folded.

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:36.180
Do you know the place where Mariko-san lives?

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:45.680
When the next year's public performance was scheduled, I sent a ticket but... there wasn't such a receiver and it got returned.

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:48.840
So we have no clues, huh...

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:52.230
I haven't seen her in seven years, after all.

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:54.680
It's only natural.

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:59.060
What kind of dream am I having?

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:01.320
It's too soon to give up!

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:04.270
If we ask the neighbours, we might find out where she went!

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:06.360
Let's split up and ask around!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:06.730
Right!

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:22.620
It seems like the restaurant was still in business until last year.

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:28.050
And a person like Mariko-san was working there until it folded.

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:29.580
No, no, no!

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:36.660
Freshly made bread

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:33.040
I can't help it! They are already closed.

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:34.840
No, no, I want a cake!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:36.640
Stop this right now!

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:38.730
No!

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:38.730
Umm...

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:39.600
Yes?

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:42.960
If you'd like, would you want to have this cake?

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:49.570
It's a Christmas cake that girl made, but it was a bit too sweet.

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.860
It'll just go to waste... Please have it.

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:55.240
Are you really alright about this?

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:55.850
Yeah...

00:16:56.230 --> 00:16:57.450
Thanks, Oji-chan!

00:16:58.270 --> 00:16:59.450
Merry Christmas.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:04.000
Thanks for coming along with me today.

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.010
We couldn't do anything for you.

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:10.120
The least I can do is play you all a song.

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:47.130
Yousuke!!

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:56.390
I've been waiting for you all this time!

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:59.950
Why didn't you come for me?

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:01.930
I'm sorry, Mariko.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:06.600
There wasn't a day that went by where I could forget about you.

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:08.620
It was the same for me too!

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:12.140
I believed that you would come back for me!

00:18:12.140 --> 00:18:17.310
Even after the restaurant closed down, I stayed here in this town looking for you!

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:27.970
Who are these children?

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:32.540
They're students at St. Marie Academy who helped me to look for you.

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:35.380
I'm happy for you, Sakaguchi-san.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:39.960
You both can finally spend Christmas together, but the cake is gone...

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:41.800
You gave it away earlier.

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:44.370
That's it!

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:47.270
How about we all make the two of them a Christmas cake?

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:48.610
Agreed!

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:53.980
We're going to return to the academy and make a special Christmas cake for you two!

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.640
Mariko-san, please write your address here.

00:18:57.670 --> 00:18:58.460
Sure...

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:18.610
What a wonderful cake!

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:20.450
It's just like a Christmas tree!

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:22.740
It's a cake called a Croqembouche.

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:27.130
My grandma made me one when I was little, and everyone got together to arrange it.

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:33.350
It's originally a wedding cake, but I thought it was appropriate for you two.

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:39.190
Well then, let's eat it together!

00:19:39.590 --> 00:19:40.990
Yay!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:43.040
No, we won't.

00:19:44.190 --> 00:19:48.120
There's a Christmas party at the academy for us, so...

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:52.040
Please enjoy your Seven Year Christmas together.

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:53.800
Well then...

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:55.290
Merry Christmas!

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:58.210
M-Merry Christmas...

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:00.050
Thank you.

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:01.320
Merry Christmas.

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:06.620
I didn't get to have a taste after we finally finished it...

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:07.860
Read the mood!

00:20:07.860 --> 00:20:08.960
That's right.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:10.960
Leave the two of them alone.

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:12.130
But...

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:16.680
If it's Ichigo-chan, I think you're too young to see that.

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:19.630
Don't treat me like a child!

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:22.570
It was a perfect cake for lovers, though.

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:30.670
It's true. You really are a free spirit, to think of turning a Croqembouche cake into a Christmas tree.

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:33.360
It's not something we'd ever think of.

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:37.120
Snow!

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:40.810
Santa is giving his blessing to their happiness.

00:20:40.810 --> 00:20:42.220
A white Christmas?

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:46.270
Well then, let's all enjoy the Christmas party!

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:46.940
Yeah!

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:07.190
May you two find happiness.

